        "id": 224787,
        "name": "Gus_Smedstad",
        "username": "Gus_Smedstad",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/e8c25b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-12-25T13:38:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hopefully the mods will merge the two threads instead of leaving one to languish.</p>\n<p>Got a mint here, everyone up, but everyone pretty badly hurt too. Setback was down to 1, but had Silver Linings in play.</p>\n<p>Built up 18&nbsp;tokens on Setback very early, but didn’t have any cards that were helping, and High Risk Behavior was feeling very high risk, so I Cashed Out for 13 cards. I probably should have done 11 so I had 7 left over for Karma. Setback’s very, very flexible after a big card draw.</p>\n<p>Wraith played a Mega Computer round 1, which takes all the danger out of leaving a Mysterious Ceremonies in play. An extra card play or 3 extra cards every round is a nice boost.</p>\n<p>Mostly I just poured out the damage. High Risk Behavior can boost damage a lot, particularly for Exceeds Expectations. Really, everyone here has some decent damage options, particularly since Wraith doesn’t need to worry about Ambuscade destroying her equipment.</p>",
